  "key": "controls-testing",
  "order": 1,
  "name": "Controls testing plan (2LoD sample testing)",
  "description": "Every in-scope asset's control data is attested by 1LoD in quarterly waves; 2LoD reviews the data quality of every submission and sample-tests the controls each quarter on a statistically sized sample.",
  "plan": {
    "title": "{year} Security NFR Controls Testing Plan",
    "function_name": "2LoD CISO Office (ICT risk control function)",
    "objective": "By {period_end_long}, 100% of Security NFR data for Tier 1 and Tier 2 ICT assets is reviewed and attested by 1LoD asset owners, with 2LoD performing a data-quality review of every submission and evidence-based sample testing of Security NFRs each quarter, giving an independent annual conclusion that feeds the ICT risk management framework review.",
    "decisions_requested": "Approve the {year} Security NFR controls testing plan: its scope (Tier 1 and Tier 2 ICT assets), objective and quarterly operating cycle.\nApprove the sampling methodology: attribute sampling at the stated confidence and tolerable deviation rate per tier, the coverage floors, risk-based top-ups and the deviation rule.\nEndorse the resourcing and the escalation triggers, and mandate asset owners to attest by each wave deadline.",
